{"seq":3,"slug":"module-boundary","title":"模块边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/module-boundary","wordCount":1232,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"模块边界\">模块边界</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模块边界设计解决大型应用中&quot;一个扁平全局容器注册了所有东西&quot;的架构退化问题。其核心目标是在 DI 容器层面实现信息隐藏——每个模块只暴露其公共接口，内部实现对外不可见、不可直接解析。NestJS 的 @Module exports 机制、.NET 的 internal 可见性 + 多项目结构、Spring 的多模块 Maven 项目都是落地手段。模块间应通过明确定义的接口契约交互，而非共享内部类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大型应用的容器组织问题\">大型应用的容器组织问题</h2><p>当应用增长到数十个服务、数百个注册时，一个扁平的全局容器会面临严重问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>命名冲突</strong>：不同模块可能注册同一接口的不同实现，互相覆盖</li>\n<li><strong>隐式耦合</strong>：任何服务都能解析到任何其他服务，模块间的访问控制形同虚设</li>\n<li><strong>启动缓慢</strong>：所有服务在应用启动时统一注册和验证</li>\n<li><strong>认知负荷</strong>：开发者无法快速定位&quot;这个服务属于哪个模块、被谁使用&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模块边界设计的目标是：<strong>在 DI 容器层面实现信息隐藏——每个模块只暴露其公共接口，内部实现对外不可见、不可直接解析。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;反模式:全局扁平容器&quot;&#10;        Global[Global Container]&#10;        Global --&gt; S1[OrderService]&#10;        Global --&gt; S2[OrderRepository]&#10;        Global --&gt; S3[PaymentGateway]&#10;        Global --&gt; S4[UserService]&#10;        Global --&gt; S5[EmailSender]&#10;        Note1[所有服务互相可见,无隔离]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;正确:模块化容器&quot;&#10;        Root[Root Container]&#10;        Root --&gt; OM[Order Module]&#10;        Root --&gt; PM[Payment Module]&#10;        Root --&gt; UM[User Module]&#10;        OM --&gt; OS[OrderService ✓ 导出]&#10;        OM --&gt; OR[OrderRepository ✗ 内部]&#10;        PM --&gt; PG[PaymentGateway ✓ 导出]&#10;        UM --&gt; US[UserService ✓ 导出]&#10;        UM --&gt; ES[EmailSender ✗ 内部]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"反模式:全局扁平容器\"\n        Global[Global Container]\n        Global --&gt; S1[OrderService]\n        Global --&gt; S2[OrderRepository]\n        Global --&gt; S3[PaymentGateway]\n        Global --&gt; S4[UserService]\n        Global --&gt; S5[EmailSender]\n        Note1[所有服务互相可见,无隔离]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"正确:模块化容器\"\n        Root[Root Container]\n        Root --&gt; OM[Order Module]\n        Root --&gt; PM[Payment Module]\n        Root --&gt; UM[User Module]\n        OM --&gt; OS[OrderService ✓ 导出]\n        OM --&gt; OR[OrderRepository ✗ 内部]\n        PM --&gt; PG[PaymentGateway ✓ 导出]\n        UM --&gt; US[UserService ✓ 导出]\n        UM --&gt; ES[EmailSender ✗ 内部]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"nestjs-的模块系统\">NestJS 的模块系统</h2><p>NestJS 提供了最显式的模块边界机制——每个 <code>@Module</code> 明确声明导入、提供和导出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Order 模块——内部有 3 个 Provider，只导出 OrderService&#10;@Module({&#10;  imports: [PaymentModule], // 声明依赖的其他模块&#10;  providers: [&#10;    OrderService,&#10;    OrderRepository, // 内部实现，不导出&#10;    OrderValidator, // 内部实现，不导出&#10;  ],&#10;  exports: [OrderService], // 只有这个可被其他模块注入&#10;})&#10;export class OrderModule {}&#10;&#10;// Payment 模块——无法直接访问 Order 模块的 OrderRepository&#10;@Module({&#10;  providers: [PaymentService, PaymentGateway],&#10;  exports: [PaymentService],&#10;})&#10;export class PaymentModule {}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Order 模块——内部有 3 个 Provider，只导出 OrderService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  imports: [PaymentModule], </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 声明依赖的其他模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  providers: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    OrderService,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    OrderRepository, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 内部实现，不导出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    OrderValidator, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 内部实现，不导出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exports: [OrderService], </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只有这个可被其他模块注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Payment 模块——无法直接访问 Order 模块的 OrderRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  providers: [PaymentService, PaymentGateway],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exports: [PaymentService],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果 <code>PaymentService</code> 试图注入 <code>OrderRepository</code>（Order 模块未导出的内部服务），NestJS 在启动时直接报错：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Error: Nest can&#39;t resolve dependencies of PaymentService (?).&#10;Please make sure that the argument OrderRepository is available in PaymentModule.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Error: Nest can't resolve dependencies of PaymentService (?).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Please make sure that the argument OrderRepository is available in PaymentModule.</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>NestJS 模块特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>providers</code></td>\n<td>模块内可用的服务列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exports</code></td>\n<td>对导入本模块的其他模块可见的服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>imports</code></td>\n<td>本模块依赖的其他模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>controllers</code></td>\n<td>本模块的 HTTP 控制器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态模块</td>\n<td><code>forRoot()</code>/<code>forFeature()</code> 支持配置化注册</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"net-的模块化注册策略\">.NET 的模块化注册策略</h2><p>.NET 内置 DI 没有原生模块概念，但通过扩展方法 + 接口约定可以实现等效的模块边界：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 每个模块定义自己的注册扩展方法&#10;public static class OrderModuleExtensions&#10;{&#10;    public static IServiceCollection AddOrderModule(&#10;        this IServiceCollection services,&#10;        IConfiguration config)&#10;    {&#10;        // 公共接口——其他模块可通过 IOrderService 访问&#10;        services.AddScoped&lt;IOrderService, OrderService&gt;();&#10;&#10;        // 内部实现——通过 internal 可见性控制&#10;        services.AddScoped&lt;OrderRepository&gt;();&#10;        services.AddScoped&lt;OrderValidator&gt;();&#10;&#10;        return services;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Composition Root 中组装&#10;builder.Services.AddOrderModule(builder.Configuration);&#10;builder.Services.AddPaymentModule(builder.Configuration);&#10;builder.Services.AddUserModule(builder.Configuration);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 每个模块定义自己的注册扩展方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public static class OrderModuleExtensions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static IServiceCollection AddOrderModule(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this IServiceCollection services,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IConfiguration config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 公共接口——其他模块可通过 IOrderService 访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        services.AddScoped&#x3C;IOrderService, OrderService>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 内部实现——通过 internal 可见性控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        services.AddScoped&#x3C;OrderRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        services.AddScoped&#x3C;OrderValidator>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return services;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Composition Root 中组装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddOrderModule(builder.Configuration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddPaymentModule(builder.Configuration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddUserModule(builder.Configuration);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>通过 C# 的 <code>internal</code> 访问修饰符强化边界：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// OrderModule 程序集中&#10;public interface IOrderService { ... }    // public: 对外可见&#10;&#10;internal class OrderService : IOrderService { ... }  // internal: 仅本程序集可见&#10;internal class OrderRepository { ... }               // internal: 仅本程序集可见\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// OrderModule 程序集中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public interface IOrderService { ... }    // public: 对外可见</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>internal class OrderService : IOrderService { ... }  // internal: 仅本程序集可见</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>internal class OrderRepository { ... }               // internal: 仅本程序集可见</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其他程序集无法直接引用 <code>OrderService</code> 或 <code>OrderRepository</code> 的具体类型——只能通过容器解析 <code>IOrderService</code> 接口。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"spring-的模块化方案\">Spring 的模块化方案</h2><p>Spring Boot 应用通常通过多模块 Maven/Gradle 项目实现模块边界：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;Maven 多模块结构&quot;&#10;        App[app 模块: 启动 + Composition Root]&#10;        App --&gt; OrderMod[order-module]&#10;        App --&gt; PaymentMod[payment-module]&#10;        App --&gt; CommonMod[common-module]&#10;        OrderMod --&gt; CommonMod&#10;        PaymentMod --&gt; CommonMod&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"Maven 多模块结构\"\n        App[app 模块: 启动 + Composition Root]\n        App --&gt; OrderMod[order-module]\n        App --&gt; PaymentMod[payment-module]\n        App --&gt; CommonMod[common-module]\n        OrderMod --&gt; CommonMod\n        PaymentMod --&gt; CommonMod\n    end</pre><p>每个 Maven 模块是独立的 JAR，只导出 <code>api</code> 包中的接口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"order-module/&#10;├── src/main/java/com/app/order/&#10;│   ├── api/                    # 公开接口——其他模块依赖这里&#10;│   │   └── OrderService.java  # public interface&#10;│   └── internal/               # 内部实现——不被外部引用&#10;│       ├── OrderServiceImpl.java&#10;│       ├── OrderRepository.java&#10;│       └── OrderConfig.java    # @Configuration 自注册\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>order-module/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── src/main/java/com/app/order/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── api/                    # 公开接口——其他模块依赖这里</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── OrderService.java  # public interface</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── internal/               # 内部实现——不被外部引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── OrderServiceImpl.java</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── OrderRepository.java</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── OrderConfig.java    # @Configuration 自注册</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Spring 的 <code>@Configuration</code> 类充当模块级 Composition Root：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"@Configuration&#10;class OrderConfig {&#10;    @Bean&#10;    OrderService orderService(OrderRepository repo, PricingEngine pricing) {&#10;        return new OrderServiceImpl(repo, pricing);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Bean&#10;    OrderRepository orderRepository(DataSource ds) {&#10;        return new JdbcOrderRepository(ds);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Configuration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Bean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    OrderService </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">orderService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(OrderRepository </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, PricingEngine </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pricing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderServiceImpl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(repo, pricing);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Bean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    OrderRepository </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">orderRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(DataSource </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JdbcOrderRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ds);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"模块间通信契约\">模块间通信契约</h2><p>模块边界不仅是代码组织问题，更是架构契约问题。模块之间应该通过明确定义的接口交互，而非共享内部类型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Order Module&quot;&#10;        OS[OrderService]&#10;        OR[OrderRepository]&#10;        OS --&gt; OR&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;Payment Module&quot;&#10;        PS[PaymentService]&#10;        PG[PaymentGateway]&#10;        PS --&gt; PG&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;共享契约层&quot;&#10;        IOS[IOrderService]&#10;        IPS[IPaymentService]&#10;        Events[领域事件]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    OS --&gt;|实现| IOS&#10;    PS --&gt;|实现| IPS&#10;    PS --&gt;|使用| IOS&#10;    OS --&gt;|发布| Events&#10;    PS --&gt;|订阅| Events\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Order Module\"\n        OS[OrderService]\n        OR[OrderRepository]\n        OS --&gt; OR\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Payment Module\"\n        PS[PaymentService]\n        PG[PaymentGateway]\n        PS --&gt; PG\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"共享契约层\"\n        IOS[IOrderService]\n        IPS[IPaymentService]\n        Events[领域事件]\n    end\n\n    OS --&gt;|实现| IOS\n    PS --&gt;|实现| IPS\n    PS --&gt;|使用| IOS\n    OS --&gt;|发布| Events\n    PS --&gt;|订阅| Events</pre><p><strong>两种跨模块通信方式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>耦合度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>接口依赖</td>\n<td>模块 A 直接调用模块 B 的服务</td>\n<td>中等（编译时依赖接口）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领域事件</td>\n<td>模块 A 发布事件，模块 B 异步处理</td>\n<td>低（只依赖事件类型）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>接口依赖适合同步、强一致性场景；领域事件适合解耦度要求更高的场景（如订单创建后发送通知邮件——通知失败不应回滚订单）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"微服务中的-di-边界\">微服务中的 DI 边界</h2><p>在微服务架构中，每个服务是独立的部署单元，天然拥有独立的 DI 容器。此时模块边界的关注点转移为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>服务内部的模块划分</strong>：即使是单个微服务，内部仍然需要模块化组织（领域层、基础设施层、API 层各有自己的注册范围）</li>\n<li><strong>跨服务通信不经过 DI</strong>：服务间通过 HTTP/gRPC/消息队列通信，不共享 DI 容器</li>\n<li><strong>共享库的 DI 注册</strong>：通用库（如认证中间件、日志 SDK）提供 <code>AddXxx()</code> 扩展方法供各服务的 Composition Root 调用</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 共享库提供的注册方法&#10;public static class AuthModuleExtensions&#10;{&#10;    public static IServiceCollection AddAuth(&#10;        this IServiceCollection services,&#10;        AuthOptions options)&#10;    {&#10;        services.AddSingleton(options);&#10;        services.AddScoped&lt;IAuthService, JwtAuthService&gt;();&#10;        services.AddScoped&lt;ITokenValidator, JwtTokenValidator&gt;();&#10;        return services;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 各微服务的 Composition Root 调用&#10;builder.Services.AddAuth(new AuthOptions { Issuer = &quot;my-app&quot; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 共享库提供的注册方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public static class AuthModuleExtensions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static IServiceCollection AddAuth(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this IServiceCollection services,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AuthOptions options)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        services.AddSingleton(options);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        services.AddScoped&#x3C;IAuthService, JwtAuthService>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        services.AddScoped&#x3C;ITokenValidator, JwtTokenValidator>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return services;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 各微服务的 Composition Root 调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddAuth(new AuthOptions { Issuer = \"my-app\" });</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"模块边界的验证\">模块边界的验证</h2><p>如何确保模块边界没有被突破？</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证手段</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>检查内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编译时隔离</td>\n<td>多项目/多 JAR</td>\n<td>internal 类型不可被外部引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>架构测试</td>\n<td>ArchUnit / NetArchTest</td>\n<td>检测禁止的依赖方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DI 配置审计</td>\n<td>自定义 health check</td>\n<td>验证只有导出接口被其他模块解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Code Review</td>\n<td>人工</td>\n<td>检查 Composition Root 中的注册是否符合模块归属</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// ArchUnit 示例：验证 Payment 模块不引用 Order 模块内部类&#10;@ArchTest&#10;static final ArchRule paymentDoesNotAccessOrderInternals =&#10;    noClasses()&#10;        .that().resideInAPackage(&quot;..payment..&quot;)&#10;        .should().accessClassesThat()&#10;        .resideInAPackage(&quot;..order.internal..&quot;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ArchUnit 示例：验证 Payment 模块不引用 Order 模块内部类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ArchTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ArchRule paymentDoesNotAccessOrderInternals </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    noClasses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">that</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resideInAPackage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"..payment..\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">should</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">accessClassesThat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resideInAPackage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"..order.internal..\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模块边界是活的约束——需要自动化测试持续守护，否则随着项目演进必然被逐渐突破。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>模块边界是 DI 从&quot;单个类如何接收依赖&quot;扩展到&quot;大型系统如何组织依赖&quot;的关键架构实践。核心原则是信息隐藏——每个模块只导出公共接口，内部实现对外不可见。NestJS 的 @Module exports、.NET 的 internal + 多项目、Spring 的多模块 Maven 结构各有落地方式，但目标一致。模块边界需要自动化验证（ArchUnit/NetArchTest）持续守护，否则随项目演进必然被逐渐突破。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>相关文档：<a href=\"composition-root\">Composition Root</a> 展示模块化注册如何在应用入口统一聚合。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模块边界","id":"模块边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"大型应用的容器组织问题","id":"大型应用的容器组织问题"},{"level":2,"text":"NestJS 的模块系统","id":"nestjs-的模块系统"},{"level":2,"text":".NET 的模块化注册策略","id":"net-的模块化注册策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Spring 的模块化方案","id":"spring-的模块化方案"},{"level":2,"text":"模块间通信契约","id":"模块间通信契约"},{"level":2,"text":"微服务中的 DI 边界","id":"微服务中的-di-边界"},{"level":2,"text":"模块边界的验证","id":"模块边界的验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"装饰器与拦截器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/decorator-interceptor"},"next":{"title":"可测试性与 Mock","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/testability-mocking"}}